        "original_id": "37203390-7e91-57be-9271-38e019e3bbc4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin Rowland, Lauri Ylönen, Paul Speare\n- Bands and Music Projects: Dexys Midnight Runners, Dexys, The Rasmus, The TKO Horns, My Beauty\n- Roles: singer-songwriter, frontman, former member\n\nFacts:\n- Kevin Rowland was born on 17 August 1953 and is an English-born singer-songwriter of Irish descent.\n- Paul Speare was born on 10 December 1955 and is a former member of Dexys Midnight Runners and The TKO Horns.\n- Lauri Ylönen was born on 23 April 1979 and is a Finnish singer-songwriter.\n- Kevin Rowland was the frontman of the pop band Dexys Midnight Runners, which is currently called Dexys.\n- Dexys Midnight Runners had several hits in the early 1980s, including \"Geno\" and \"Come On Eileen,\" and both songs reached number one on the U.K. singles charts.\n- Lauri Ylönen is best known as the frontman of the Finnish alternative rock band The Rasmus.\n- My Beauty is a solo album by Kevin Rowland, the lead singer of Dexys Midnight Runners.",
